# Milestone 8i: the wheel as the bellows. Render with
#   --set mod_wheel=1
# The modulation wheel is where the bellows is: 0 shut, 127 open its
# whole travel (12 L); what sounds is the wheel moving, up pulling and
# down pushing.
# 1. C4 held with the wheel still: nothing, until the wheel moves at
#    10 steps a second.
# 2. "Frere Jacques" (traditional) in Musette, the wheel rising (pull),
#    then turning at 11.5 s and falling (push).
# 3. A C major chord, the bellows shaken: two steps up and down every
#    70 ms.
